                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>
                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>
                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>
                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>
                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>
                <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>> <<BMass>>

    SET-PARAM 'T-FUEL' BUND 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 
                            750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0
                            750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 
                            750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0 750.0
    SET-PARAM 'T-COOL' BUND 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0
                            543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0
                            543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0
                            543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0 543.0
    SET-PARAM 'D-COOL' BUND 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0
                            700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0
                            700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0
                            700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0 700.0

    REACTOR-POW <<powi>> 
    AXIAL-PFORM <<Pfact1>> <<Pfact2>> <<Pfact3>> <<Pfact4>> <<Pfact5>> 
    <<Pfact6>> <<Pfact7>> <<Pfact8>> <<Pfact9>> <<Pfact10>>
    <<Pfact11>> <<Pfact12>> <<Pfact13>> <<Pfact14>> <<Pfact15>> 
    <<Pfact16>> <<Pfact17>> <<Pfact18>> <<Pfact19>> <<Pfact20>>
    <<Pfact21>> <<Pfact22>> <<Pfact23>> <<Pfact24>> <<Pfact25>> 
    <<Pfact26>> <<Pfact27>> <<Pfact28>> <<Pfact29>> <<Pfact30>>
    <<Pfact31>> <<Pfact32>> <<Pfact33>> <<Pfact34>> <<Pfact35>> 
    <<Pfact36>> <<Pfact37>> <<Pfact38>> <<Pfact39>> <<Pfact40>>
